KG42.register("clusters-9c0bafe1337819acbc16a465",{"id":"45-heat_pump_flexibility::v142-d-CL001","paper":"45-heat_pump_flexibility","label":"Bidirectional declaration for electric energy traded in advance and price adjustment for unmatched trades","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL001","label":"Bidirectional declaration for electric energy traded in advance and price adjustment for unmatched trades","market_meaning":"Within the advance-trading window permitted by the electric-energy product, prosumers determine the declared quantity based on forecasts and the MPC plan, and adopt buy and sell bid trajectories in opposite directions; unmet demand can continue to be declared in subsequent clearing rounds. The product window, the individual strategy horizon, and the clearing period are retained separately.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["bidding","clearing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"They all belong to the same LEM mechanism, but the market's 24 h window is not equal to the 6–24 h strategy horizon selected by each prosumer. Buyer and seller parameters are retained separately, and R003 provides only the clearing and feedback interface.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"The product's tradable period constitutes a declaration condition, the buy and sell strategies constitute complementary decisions, and the clearing result constitutes a condition for demand re-declaration. Welfare optimization, concrete allocation, and settlement have independent decision significance and are assembled separately.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Carries the determination of demand quantity, the buyer bid, and the re-declaration condition after an unmatched trade."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R002","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Carries the supply plan and the seller bid, complementing the buyer strategy."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R012","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"Limits the declared product and its advance-trading window, without adding a mathematical product object."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R003","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"References only the interface through which declarations enter clearing and rolling clearing, and does not duplicate ownership of the clearing rules here."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R012","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X002","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C007"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e15"],"rationale":"The advance-trading window and the individual strategy horizon jointly limit the temporal scope of demand declaration; the source does not require the two to be equal."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C004","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C006"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g01-e15"],"rationale":"The source describes the determination of forecast and MPC quantities in parallel with buy and sell bid strategies in opposite directions; the two chains form a bidirectional declaration candidate, and this is not taken to mean that different participants have the same parameters."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C008"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::E::v141-c-R001-E001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e14"],"rationale":"The fact that demand remains unmet after clearing is the condition for continuing declaration and adjusting the bid for unmatched demand; here only the feedback relationship is assembled, and no C edge is added or reversed."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L004","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R003","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::bidding.supply","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R003::E::v141-c-R003-E003","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e14"],"rationale":"The declaration generated by the supply plan enters the same double-auction clearing; R002 has no independent clearing edge, and this mapping does not modify its frozen graph."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL001-O001","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::bidding.demand","v141-c-R003::V::bidding.demand"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R001::V::bidding.demand","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e14"],"rationale":"Both are demand-declaration nodes of the same mechanism; the representative selection is for display only, and declaration and clearing constraints are retained separately."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL001-O002","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R002::V::bidding.supply","v141-c-R003::V::bidding.supply"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R002::V::bidding.supply","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e11"],"rationale":"Both refer to the supply-declaration function and do not merge other objects of the two chains."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL001-O003","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::clearing.local","v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e11"],"rationale":"The clearing referenced by the demand re-declaration condition and the local clearing of R003 are the same function node."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-CL001-O004","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002","v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C006"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g01-e15"],"rationale":"The two items reference the same buyer bid expression but respectively describe unmatched-trade updating and the initial linear strategy; the conditions differ, so they are not collapsed into the same constraint or added as two independent rules."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G001","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The time-discretization convention of the bid expression is not yet closed: the clearing period is 15 min, the strategy horizon is given in h, and the increment is called the next-time-step increment; R001 also does not separately declare objects for the current time and delivery time.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002","v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-P003","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P005","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P006","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C003","v141-c-R003::phi::v141-c-R003-C008"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e15"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Upstream is to verify the time units, step size, and delivery-boundary conventions and revise the declarations as authorized; D does not add conversion factors or borrow seller objects to repair the buyer formula."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G002","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The upper and lower limits, horizons, and increments with the same names in the buy and sell chains have no participant-identity Mapping; the buyer lists the horizon as a design variable, whereas the seller lists it as a parameter, so it cannot be presumed that the choices or numerical values of the participants are consistent.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::x::v141-c-R001-X002","v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-P001","v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-P002","v141-c-R001::theta::v141-c-R001-P003","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P001","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P002","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P003","v141-c-R002::theta::v141-c-R002-P004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g01-e15"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Clarify the participant, transaction-instance scope, and units of the parameters; before that, keep the different local roles and original objects independent."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G003","category":"upstream_missing","description":"Between the forecast, the MPC plan, and the declared quantity there is only a procedural description; R001 and R002 have no corresponding quantity objects or transfer constraints; the existing C2 contract issue in R012 has also not received a subsequent explicit revision.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R012"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C005","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g02-e10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"If upstream needs closure at the quantity level, it should explicitly extract the quantity and time correspondence from plan to declaration and resolve the reference contract of R012; currently only the procedural candidate is retained."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G004","category":"unverified_source","description":"This cluster uses unreviewed candidate evidence permitted by the experiment; its source_status remains unverified.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R002","v141-c-R003","v141-c-R012"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e01","v141-b-g01-e05","v141-b-g01-e07","v141-b-g01-e11","v141-b-g01-e14","v141-b-g01-e15","v141-b-g02-e10"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"A human is to check the source transcription, formulas, and this cluster's mappings; this round does not claim to have passed independent source or scientific review."}]},"rule_refs":["45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R001","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R002","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R012","45-heat_pump_flexibility::v141-c-R003"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-230dbf46f02b4bfe","COMP-89ca1857e29bb0c7","KG40-12aedc3eec573697","KG40-20f45ec4bdcbac06","KG40-72006c4bf7355110","KG40-a82c49d45641943a"]});
